><p class="kpi__value num">$60.00</p><p class="kpi__delta"><span class="trend trend--good"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 19V5"></path><path d="M5 12l7-7 7 7"></path></svg><span class="num">200%</span><span class="sr-only"> (favorable)</span></span><span class="kpi__compare hide-mobile">vs Aug 1 – Aug 31, 2026</span></p><div class="kpi__footer"><span class="muted">Prior: <span class="money">$20.00</span></span></div></article><article class="card card--padded kpi"><div class="kpi__top"><h3 class="kpi__label">Net margin</h3></div><p class="kpi__value num">60.0%</p><p class="kpi__delta"><span class="trend trend--good"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 19V5"></path><path d="M5 12l7-7 7 7"></path></svg><span class="num">20.0 pts</span><span class="sr-only"> (favorable)</span></span><span class="kpi__compare hide-mobile">vs Aug 1 – Aug 31, 2026</span></p><div class="kpi__footer"><span class="muted">Prior: 40.0%</span></div></article></section><p class="notice notice--warn" role="note"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22a10 10 0 1 0 0-20 10 10 0 0 0 0 20z"></path><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg> <span class="money money--neg">-$10.00</span> of activity in this range is uncategorized or needs review. It is included in net income.</p><div class="dash-grid"><section class="card card--padded dash-grid__wide"><header class="card__header"><div class="card__titles"><h2 class="card__title">Revenue, expenses &amp; net income</h2><p class="card__subtitle">By month since January 2026. Click a month to focus on it.</p></div></header><div class="chart"><ul class="legend"><li><span class="legend__swatch legend__swatch--square tone-rev" aria-hidden="true"></span>Net revenue</li><li><span class="legend__swatch legend__swatch--square tone-exp" aria-hidden="true"></span>Expenses</li><li><span class="legend__swatch legend__swatch--line tone-net" aria-hidden="true"></span>Net income</li></ul><div class="chart__canvas"><svg width="640" height="280" viewBox="0 0 640 280" role="img" aria-label="Net revenue and expenses as bars, net income as a line, by month"><g><line class="chart-grid chart-grid--zero" x1="56" x2="628" y1="250" y2="250"></line><text class="chart-axis" x="48" y="250" dy="0.32em" text-anchor="end">$0.0</text></g><g><line class="chart-grid" x1="56" x2="628" y1="190.5" y2="190.5"></line><text class="chart-axis" x="48" y="190.5" dy="0.32em" text-anchor="end">$25.0</text></g><g><line class="chart-grid" x1="56" x2="628" y1="131" y2="131"></line><text class="chart-axis" x="48" y="131" dy="0.32em" text-anchor="end">$50.0</text></g><g><line class="chart-grid" x1="56" x2="628" y1="71.5" y2="71.5"></line><text class="chart-axis" x="48" y="71.5" dy="0.32em" text-anchor="end">$75.0</text></g><g><line class="chart-grid" x1="56" x2="628" y1="12" y2="12"></line><text class="chart-axis" x="48" y="12" dy="0.32em" text-anchor="end">$100.0</text></g><g class="is-dim"><rect class="chart-bar tone-rev" x="175.5" y="131" width="22" height="119" rx="2.5"></rect><rect class="chart-bar tone-exp" x="200.5" y="178.6000" width="22" height="71.3999" rx="2.5"></rect><text class="chart-axis" x="199" y="270" text-anchor="middle">Aug</text></g><g class=""><rect class="chart-bar tone-rev" x="461.5" y="12" width="22" height="238" rx="2.5"></rect><rect class="chart-bar tone-exp" x="486.5" y="154.8" width="22" height="95.1999" rx="2.5"></rect><text class="chart-axis" x="485" y="270" text-anchor="middle">Sep</text></g><path class="chart-line tone-net" d="M199.0,202.4 L485.0,107.2" fill="none"></path><circle class="chart-dot tone-net" cx="199" cy="202.4" r="3"></circle><circle class="chart-dot tone-net" cx="485" cy="107.2000" r="3"></circle><rect class="chart-hit is-clickable" x="56" y="12" width="286" height="238"><title>Aug 2026: Net revenue $50.00, Expenses $30.00, Net income $20.00</title></rect><rect class="chart-hit is-clickable" x="342" y="12" width="286" height="238"><title>Sep 2026: Net revenue $100.00, Expenses $40.00, Net income $60.00</title></rect></svg></div><div class="sr-only"><table><caption>Net revenue and expenses as bars, net income as a line, by month</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Period</th><th scope="col">Net revenue</th><th scope="col">Expenses</th><th scope="col">Net income</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Aug 2026</th><td>$50.00</td><td>$30.00</td><td>$20.00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sep 2026</th><td>$100.00</td><td>$40.00</td><td>$60.00</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="card card--padded"><header class="card__header"><div class="card__titles"><h2 class="card__title">Expense breakdown</h2><p class="card__subtitle">Cost of revenue and operating expenses</p></div></header><ul class="barlist" aria-label="Expenses by category"><li class="barlist__item is-clickable"><button type="button" class="barlist__button"><span class="barlist__label"><span class="barlist__name" title="Software &amp; Licenses">Software &amp; Licenses</span></span><span class="barlist__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="barlist__bar tone-cat-1" style="width: 100%;"></span></span><span class="barlist__value"><span class="money">$30.00</span><span class="barlist__share num">75.0%</span></span></button></li><li class="barlist__item is-clickable"><button type="button" class="barlist__button"><span class="barlist__label"><span class="barlist__name" title="Office/Other">Office/Other</span></span><span class="barlist__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="barlist__bar tone-cat-2" style="width: 33.3333%;"></span></span><span class="barlist__value"><span class="money">$10.00</span><span class="barlist__share num">25.0%</span></span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card card--padded"><header class="card__header"><div class="card__titles"><h2 class="card__title">Revenue split</h2><p class="card__subtitle">Hosting versus consulting</p></div></header><div class="donut"><div class="donut__ring"><svg width="168" height="168" viewBox="0 0 168 168" role="img" aria-label="Revenue by line of business"><circle class="donut__track" cx="84" cy="84" r="72" fill="none" stroke-width="18"></circle><path class="donut__slice tone-biz-branda" d="M84.00,12.00 A72,72 0 1 1 14.99,63.47" fill="none" stroke-width="18"><title>Hosting: $80.00 (80.0%)</title></path><path class="donut__slice tone-biz-consulting" d="M15.52,61.75 A72,72 0 0 1 82.20,12.02" fill="none" stroke-width="18"><title>Consulting: $20.00 (20.0%)</title></path></svg><div class="donut__center" aria-hidden="true"><span class="donut__center-label">Gross revenue</span><span class="donut__center-value num">$100</span></div></div><ul class="donut__legend"><li class=""><span class="legend__swatch legend__swatch--square tone-biz-branda" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="donut__legend-label">Hosting</span><span class="money">$80.00</span><span class="donut__legend-share num">80.0%</span></li><li class=""><span class="legend__swatch legend__swatch--square tone-biz-consulting" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="donut__legend-label">Consulting</span><span class="money">$20.00</span><span class="donut__legend-share num">20.0%</span></li></ul></div></section><section class="card card--padded"><header class="card__header"><div class="card__titles"><h2 class="card__title">Cash by account</h2><p class="card__subtitle">Statement balances when an anchor is set. Cards are the amount owed.</p></div><div class="card__actions"><a class="link-quiet" href="/accounts">All accounts</a></div></header><dl class="cash-summary"><div><dt>Cash</dt><dd><span class="money money--strong">$1,234.56</span></dd></div><div><dt>Cards owed</dt><dd><span class="money money--strong">$0.00</span></dd></div><div><dt>Net</dt><dd><span class="money money--strong">$1,234.56</span></dd></div></dl><ul class="barlist" aria-label="Cash accounts"><li class="barlist__item is-clickable"><button type="button" class="barlist__button"><span class="barlist__label"><span class="barlist__name" title="Bank 1111">Bank 1111</span><span class="barlist__meta">imported activity · Sep 30, 2026</span></span><span class="barlist__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="barlist__bar tone-rev" style="width: 100%;"></span></span><span class="barlist__value"><span class="money">$1,234.56</span></span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card card--padded"><header class="card__header"><div class="card__titles"><h2 class="card__title">Top vendors</h2><p class="card__subtitle">By spend in this range</p></div><div class="card__actions"><a class="link-quiet" href="/vendors">All vendors</a></div></header><ul class="barlist" aria-label="Top vendors by spend"><li class="barlist__item is-clickable"><button type="button" class="barlist__button"><span class="barlist__label"><span class="barlist__name" title="ZZZ RENT">ZZZ RENT</span><span class="barlist__meta">1 charge · Office/Other</span></span><span class="barlist__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="barlist__bar tone-exp" style="width: 100%;"></span></span><span class="barlist__value"><span class="money">$100.00</span></span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card card--padded"><header class="card__header"><div class="card__titles"><h2 class="card__title">Upcoming bills</h2><p class="card__subtitle">Next 30 days <span class="badge badge--warn">Estimate</span></p></div><div class="card__actions"><a class="link-quiet" href="/calendar">Calendar</a></div></header><ul class="bill-list"><li class="bill-list__item"><span class="bill-list__date"><span class="bill-list_